{A.1 = 1-6}
11=1.	King who gathers up the divine powers of heaven and earth, foremost son of @wDN{Enki}, @wDN{Marduk}, 
15=2.	mighty lord, perfect hero, foremost of the @wDN{Great Princes} @noteref{a name for the @wDN{Igigi} gods}, strong one of the @wDN{Anuna}, 
19=3.	the great gods who have given him justice and judgment! Great prince, descendant of holy @wDN{An}, 
23=4.	lord who decides destinies, who has everything in his grasp (?), wise, 
27=5.	august knower of hearts, whose divinity is manifest, who shows concern for all that he looks upon! 
31=6.	Your ancestor @wDN{An}, king of the gods, has made your lordship effective against the armies of heaven and earth. 

{A.7 = 7-10}
35=7.	He has given you the supervision of great august commands of heaven and earth, he has bound to your hand the shepherd's crook that curbs the foreign lands, 
39=8.	he has made you excel among the great gods, and in addition has given you, to control them, the royal sceptre and the ritual ordinances of the gods. 
43=9.	@wDN{Enlil} has fixed as your destiny kingship over the totality of heaven and earth and has relieved you of any rivals; 
47=10.	he has made you eminent among the @wDN{Anuna}, and has bestowed on you the exercise of domination. 

