{B.12 = 12}
63=12.	@wDN{Marduk}, in all quarters of the heavens they have made shine forth like @wDN{Utu} the lordship of prince @wRN{Abī-@wDN{Ešuḫ}}, the beloved son of your heart, and have relieved him of any rivals. 

