{C.14 = 14}
79=14.	The lordship of the hero standing in all his strength upon this august pedestal is indeed eminent in heaven and earth. The lordship of @wDN{Marduk} standing in all his strength upon this august pedestal, is indeed eminent in heaven and earth. 
